  "details": "Remove the dynamic materials list from the SDK3 scene descriptor, or don't populate it if it's not easy to remove.\nAs far as I am aware, the dynamic material list is only used in SDK2 to sync material changes from the SetMaterial VRCTrigger. Which isn't needed in SDK3 since we can sync materials ourselves.\nThere are cases where the dynamic material list can include materials in the build that aren't needed so it'd be good to have it removed.",
